-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DCC model train captures
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Captures of an OpenRemise S3Main command station.


Logic analyzer setup
--------------------

The logic analyzer used was a nanoDLA (samplerate 1 or 2MHz).

  Probe       DCC
  ------------------
  0           P track
  1           N track
  2           BIDI


